WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.220
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.860 --> 01:15.060
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.000 --> 01:21.560
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.340 --> 01:24.070
...is often called this...

01:24.140 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:58.440 --> 02:00.240
Is something wrong, Mr. Kamiya?

02:03.950 --> 02:06.710
I just saw the worst future.

02:07.350 --> 02:09.910
The vision of the
downfall of mankind...

02:12.060 --> 02:13.050
Mr. Kamiya...

02:14.590 --> 02:17.150
Naoto Kirihara and Naoya Kirihara...

02:18.160 --> 02:20.190
These two are dangerous.

02:25.370 --> 02:26.740
<i>Annihilation</i>

02:26.740 --> 02:30.570
<i>Annihilation
Episode 9</i>

02:31.580 --> 02:34.310
<i>Yamake Line Derailment Accident</i>

03:37.810 --> 03:39.070
No, you can't.

03:40.580 --> 03:42.910
You have to hold on
to my hand firmly.

03:49.620 --> 03:50.550
Brother?

04:04.240 --> 04:05.970
This is a customer call.

04:06.040 --> 04:07.700
Mr. Naoya Kirihara.

04:07.870 --> 04:12.210
The customer you were with is
waiting at the front information booth.

04:15.180 --> 04:17.210
This is a customer call.

04:17.680 --> 04:19.480
Mr. Naoya Kirihara.

04:19.850 --> 04:24.760
The customer you were with is
waiting at the front information booth.

04:36.340 --> 04:37.460
Brother...

04:38.200 --> 04:41.040
You're not in elementary school
anymore, don't lose me in a crowd.

04:41.110 --> 04:43.370
Brother, where did you go?

04:43.710 --> 04:46.010
I was just walking normally.

04:46.510 --> 04:48.340
H-Hey! Wait up!

04:52.720 --> 04:54.150
There was an umbrella.

04:54.220 --> 04:55.190
Huh?

04:56.720 --> 05:01.790
The one that lady named Hikita that
took care of us first at the laboratory had.

05:02.460 --> 05:03.790
The red umbrella, right?

05:05.600 --> 05:07.060
You saw it too?

05:07.370 --> 05:08.260
Yeah.

05:08.970 --> 05:11.700
But what's wrong with that?

05:13.910 --> 05:15.640
Hey, Brother!

05:25.080 --> 05:26.680
How does it look, Brother?

05:27.850 --> 05:29.820
Why did you buy
something like that?

05:29.890 --> 05:31.320
I don't know.

05:32.830 --> 05:35.820
While I was looking at it,
all of a sudden I wanted to buy it.

05:35.960 --> 05:37.190
Why is that?

05:37.530 --> 05:41.190
Something like that won't
protect you from reading, right?

05:41.770 --> 05:44.290
Yeah, you're right, but...

05:48.670 --> 05:49.540
Hey.

05:49.810 --> 05:51.470
I'm thirsty.

05:52.010 --> 05:53.810
Brother, you want something too?

05:55.110 --> 05:56.580
It's okay!

05:56.780 --> 05:58.880
I'm not in elementary school anymore.

05:58.980 --> 05:59.970
That's true.

06:00.050 --> 06:01.580
Then could you get me a coffee?

06:01.650 --> 06:02.520
Okay.

06:13.870 --> 06:16.560
Does he want hot or cold?

06:18.970 --> 06:20.230
Hot should be fine.

06:32.750 --> 06:34.650
Naoya Kirihara.

06:44.660 --> 06:45.790
Wait!

07:02.750 --> 07:04.150
L-Let go!

07:04.780 --> 07:06.550
Naoya Kirihara.

07:11.790 --> 07:12.690
Naoya!

07:12.830 --> 07:13.790
Are you okay?

07:14.230 --> 07:15.520
Brother...

07:18.760 --> 07:19.920
Monster...

07:20.170 --> 07:22.900
You guys are definitely demons.

07:22.970 --> 07:26.270
You guys are going to
lead mankind to its downfall!

07:26.770 --> 07:28.970
It's exactly how Mr. Kamiya said!

07:29.110 --> 07:30.040
Kamiya?

07:32.240 --> 07:33.140
Hold up!

07:33.450 --> 07:34.780
No, Brother!

07:35.380 --> 07:38.110
That person is really weak.

07:40.590 --> 07:42.550
If you use your power, it's dangerous.

07:43.020 --> 07:45.580
There's blood!
Where did you get hurt?

07:46.630 --> 07:47.990
It's nothing serious.

07:50.760 --> 07:52.990
Damn it. Why did she do this?

07:53.130 --> 07:57.230
To have murderous intent
turned toward you is a scary thing.

07:58.200 --> 08:00.360
This time it's the
downfall of mankind, huh?

08:02.880 --> 08:04.470
Tsukasa Kamiya...

08:05.380 --> 08:07.810
The modern day Nostradamus?

08:07.980 --> 08:09.140
Yeah...

08:09.210 --> 08:11.740
Normally he works
just like everybody else...

08:11.820 --> 08:14.720
...and on his days off he
looks into people's futures.

08:15.150 --> 08:16.920
He's a person with
the power of precognition.

08:17.120 --> 08:18.850
He's working just like everybody else?

08:18.920 --> 08:19.820
Yeah.

08:19.890 --> 08:22.090
There are people like that, huh?

08:22.790 --> 08:25.890
People started spreading word
saying his predictions are true and...

08:25.960 --> 08:28.760
...there has been enthusiastic
believers out there too.

08:29.700 --> 08:32.190
The lady from before was like that.

08:32.470 --> 08:37.470
Maybe Kamiya said if they don't kill us,
mankind would go down or something.

08:37.540 --> 08:39.770
If that's so, he's an offensive guy.

08:41.010 --> 08:42.310
I get it.

08:42.380 --> 08:44.320
That's why I bought that.

08:45.320 --> 08:46.220
The gloves?

08:46.290 --> 08:47.120
Yeah.

08:47.820 --> 08:50.620
Maybe I thought I had
to protect my hands.

08:50.860 --> 08:52.480
That's most likely why.

08:52.560 --> 08:54.460
I'm glad it was only a scratch.

08:55.390 --> 08:59.350
It's more of a hassle if the
doctor touches your hands.

08:59.870 --> 09:02.930
Brother, maybe the transition is...

09:03.700 --> 09:05.800
...about the downfall of mankind.

09:06.610 --> 09:08.800
There's no way that's possible.

09:10.110 --> 09:11.230
Yeah...

09:43.980 --> 09:45.710
The image of death...

09:46.780 --> 09:48.470
What's the meaning of this?

10:04.800 --> 10:06.160
Come in.

10:08.670 --> 10:10.190
I'm so sorry.

10:11.600 --> 10:13.090
Is something wrong?

10:13.270 --> 10:16.370
Mr. Kamiya, it was a
long-awaited prediction from you...

10:16.440 --> 10:19.070
...but I was not able to be of any help.

10:19.440 --> 10:23.400
I don't remember telling you
to kill the Kirihara brothers.

10:23.480 --> 10:25.350
But then mankind will...

10:25.420 --> 10:30.650
I said they might have a connection
to the flow of the downfall of mankind.

10:32.190 --> 10:34.180
Everything is fate.

10:34.830 --> 10:38.020
They had a fate not to be killed by you.

10:40.400 --> 10:43.100
Please let me prepare your meal.

10:47.070 --> 10:48.270
You are...

10:48.710 --> 10:49.500
Yes?

10:49.840 --> 10:52.370
You're going to attack someone else.

10:53.310 --> 10:54.400
The opponent is...

10:55.650 --> 10:56.880
I do not know.

10:57.220 --> 10:59.310
I wasn't able to see that far.

10:59.380 --> 11:02.480
And after that,
what is going to happen?

11:02.590 --> 11:04.250
You will be put into jail.

11:04.320 --> 11:05.150
What?

11:05.890 --> 11:10.790
I saw you were smiling
in happiness within the isolation cell.

11:25.680 --> 11:26.940
That's the building.

11:27.080 --> 11:28.070
Yeah.

11:28.150 --> 11:30.910
<i>Daitou Trading</i>

11:31.420 --> 11:35.080
Excuse me, is
Mr. Tsukasa Kamiya presently here?

11:35.850 --> 11:37.720
Do you have an appointment with him?

11:37.860 --> 11:38.690
No.

11:42.330 --> 11:46.460
Um, are you two Mr. Naoto
and Naoya Kirihara?

11:46.830 --> 11:47.800
Yes.

11:54.510 --> 11:56.770
Nice to meet you. I'm Kamiya.

12:10.420 --> 12:11.910
Those gloves are?

12:16.290 --> 12:18.260
He was attacked by a woman.

12:18.530 --> 12:20.230
He was about to be killed.

12:20.930 --> 12:22.920
That was unfortunate.

12:23.270 --> 12:25.570
Weren't you the one
that made her do it?

12:26.610 --> 12:29.840
I saw the vision of
the downfall of mankind.

12:30.340 --> 12:33.830
I only gave the hint that you guys
were going to be affected by it.

12:34.010 --> 12:36.810
That's the only thing I told her.

12:36.880 --> 12:39.780
Because of that,
his life was in danger!

12:39.950 --> 12:41.110
Brother...

12:43.820 --> 12:47.720
How are we connected
with the downfall of mankind?

12:47.860 --> 12:51.560
The premonition of a downfall
isn't that unusual.

12:51.960 --> 12:56.990
Many prophets and religionists have
predicted the downfall of mankind.

12:57.070 --> 12:58.730
That's something I already know!

12:58.800 --> 13:02.640
It's thought that Nostradamus'
predictions were off...

13:02.710 --> 13:05.340
...but it might just be
that the year was off.

13:05.610 --> 13:10.070
There are many people that think
the world is headed toward downfall.

13:10.250 --> 13:13.510
Global warming, earthquakes, wars...

13:14.490 --> 13:18.350
How is it that we're going to be
connected with something like that?

13:18.590 --> 13:19.720
No.

13:20.330 --> 13:23.560
What I saw wasn't
something from those things.

13:24.730 --> 13:26.320
The black flow?

13:26.670 --> 13:28.000
That's right.

13:29.840 --> 13:30.930
A disease...

13:31.500 --> 13:33.400
A disease caused by a virus...

14:14.280 --> 14:15.340
<i>Castella Cake</i>

15:12.270 --> 15:13.700
What did you see?

15:13.940 --> 15:15.170
The future...

15:15.670 --> 15:18.140
Mankind was moving
toward its downfall.

15:18.210 --> 15:19.140
What?

15:19.440 --> 15:22.110
Didn't you do a reading
into this guy's head?

15:22.180 --> 15:25.550
No. It was definitely
a vision of the future.

15:25.980 --> 15:27.920
That's an amazing power.

15:28.420 --> 15:30.550
You were able to follow me.

15:30.890 --> 15:34.550
By both of us trying
to see the future...

15:34.630 --> 15:37.060
...the wave of the supernatural
power became stronger...

15:37.130 --> 15:40.060
...and we were able to
see a clearer vision.

15:40.130 --> 15:44.530
How are we going to be part of the
downfall of mankind due to a virus?

15:45.340 --> 15:47.360
Even if you don't mean to...

15:47.440 --> 15:52.100
...before you know it, you could
become part of the black flow.

15:52.180 --> 15:55.770
You don't even know how we're
connected, but our lives are in danger?

15:56.280 --> 15:57.480
How idiotic is that?

16:01.750 --> 16:02.780
Kamiya!

16:03.390 --> 16:04.750
Chief Kurokawa...

16:04.820 --> 16:07.380
I'll tell you once that
this is a company!

16:07.530 --> 16:10.090
You can make a profit off
of your fraud predictions...

16:10.160 --> 16:13.260
...but don't forget that right now
is during your working hours!

16:13.330 --> 16:16.160
We are in the middle of talking
about a very important matter.

16:16.230 --> 16:18.860
It's something that is going to
affect the future of this company.

16:18.940 --> 16:20.700
Could you please leave?

16:21.070 --> 16:24.200
You're most likely telling them
your predictions of lies anyway!

16:24.610 --> 16:25.540
Lies?

16:27.350 --> 16:28.840
What you said...

16:29.380 --> 16:34.410
Excuse me, but that was something
you wanted to hear, so I told you.

16:34.720 --> 16:36.690
I won't believe that...

16:37.090 --> 16:39.520
...that I'm going to
die of a heart attack!

16:40.460 --> 16:45.560
Most likely after you die you will
realize that my prediction was true.

16:45.660 --> 16:47.460
K-Kamiya...

16:51.870 --> 16:53.500
Wh-What's wrong?

16:53.670 --> 16:55.760
N-No, nothing...

16:56.140 --> 16:58.800
He is also another excellent
supernatural power holder.

17:00.310 --> 17:01.970
Did you see something?

17:02.050 --> 17:03.510
N-No...

17:03.580 --> 17:06.810
Hey, you just made a weird face.

17:06.890 --> 17:08.480
You saw something, right?

17:09.050 --> 17:11.220
Please tell me what you saw!

17:12.590 --> 17:13.890
I'm going to die?

17:13.960 --> 17:16.120
Am I going to die? Hey!

17:17.660 --> 17:19.390
D-Damn it...

17:20.000 --> 17:23.800
I-I definitely won't believe
those predictions!

17:28.570 --> 17:30.970
You told that man that
he was going to die?

17:31.580 --> 17:34.480
You aren't fit as a prophet.

17:34.780 --> 17:38.580
If you have too much empathy
for others, you cannot predict.

17:39.020 --> 17:41.350
Think about the other
person a little more!

17:41.690 --> 17:45.280
My duty is to tell them what I see.

17:45.390 --> 17:48.360
Is that how you
manipulate people all the time?

17:48.460 --> 17:53.060
How she attacked you guys was
something she did on her own.

17:53.130 --> 17:54.560
On her own, you say?

17:55.930 --> 17:59.170
I don't remember
ordering someone to do that.

18:00.440 --> 18:01.200
That's a lie!

18:01.940 --> 18:06.070
You know how your words
sound to the other person...

18:06.140 --> 18:07.480
...so that's why you tell them!

18:07.550 --> 18:10.740
Predictions are pointers to
make a decision for the future...

18:10.820 --> 18:12.480
...and it's also a way.

18:13.690 --> 18:18.520
I am using the power that
was given to me for this world.

18:18.690 --> 18:22.850
Your prediction is in
the making of a murderer!

18:23.430 --> 18:26.230
You think something like that
is going to be forgiven?

18:36.210 --> 18:37.870
Please leave.

18:38.310 --> 18:41.040
It seems as even if we talk
more than this, it's no use.

18:41.280 --> 18:42.270
Naoya...

18:42.350 --> 18:43.210
Yeah...

18:58.900 --> 19:00.660
A golden elephant...

19:01.670 --> 19:04.570
Do you have something
that comes to your mind?

19:04.770 --> 19:06.240
Regarding a golden elephant...

19:07.340 --> 19:08.200
No...

19:08.970 --> 19:10.670
What about a silver snake?

19:11.610 --> 19:13.600
No... I don't...

19:53.020 --> 19:55.140
Kanako Kurahashi...

19:55.790 --> 19:56.880
I saw it.

19:57.220 --> 19:59.250
I wasn't able to see it till now.

20:00.930 --> 20:03.890
I was able to see what I have
been looking for for a long time.

20:04.230 --> 20:06.200
The origin of the virus...

20:06.830 --> 20:09.930
The virus hasn't been developed yet.

20:11.270 --> 20:13.830
It's soon, though.

20:19.340 --> 20:20.570
Miss Kurahashi.

20:20.650 --> 20:21.740
Hold on a second!

20:22.410 --> 20:24.680
I came up with an
amazing idea just now.

20:24.750 --> 20:27.120
An activity control
medicine for the virus.

20:27.420 --> 20:31.080
If this experiment goes well,
we might be able to make...

20:31.160 --> 20:33.950
...a medicine that can stop
the movement of HIV.

20:34.760 --> 20:36.420
You don't remember?

20:36.660 --> 20:37.530
What?

20:37.960 --> 20:41.520
I got my friend to get us
the tickets to the play.

20:41.730 --> 20:44.070
You were saying you
wanted to see it, so...

20:44.140 --> 20:44.970
What?

20:45.940 --> 20:47.270
You forgot?

20:47.410 --> 20:49.900
I'm sorry. Please go alone.

20:53.880 --> 20:54.810
What?

20:54.980 --> 20:56.710
I can't be the one?

20:57.020 --> 20:58.140
Huh?

20:58.220 --> 20:58.770
Please?

20:58.850 --> 21:00.150
C-Come on!

21:01.920 --> 21:03.390
Don't ridicule me!

21:03.620 --> 21:05.520
You are my assistant!

21:05.660 --> 21:08.460
You are only my partner
on the level of business!

21:11.930 --> 21:14.660
<i>Yamake Line Derailment Accident</i>

21:14.730 --> 21:16.700
<i>Rush Hour Traffic Chaos</i>

21:44.860 --> 21:45.760
Yes.

21:45.830 --> 21:47.260
It's me.

21:47.730 --> 21:50.260
What? Someone that
wants to see me?

21:50.340 --> 21:53.830
Apparently it's an emergency,
so they want to see you right away.

22:00.140 --> 22:02.610
Um, I'm Kurahashi.

22:05.050 --> 22:06.110
Brother...

22:07.450 --> 22:09.780
You're Miss Kanako Kurahashi, right?

22:09.850 --> 22:11.250
Y-Yes...

22:16.230 --> 22:17.750
I-Is there something...

22:29.910 --> 22:38.710
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

22:38.780 --> 22:47.560
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

22:47.630 --> 22:56.400
<i>A single shadow looked like light
in this world that I'm imprisoned in.</i>

22:56.470 --> 23:05.210
<i>The rain of May became lighter
as it was kindly shining tomorrow.</i>

23:05.280 --> 23:09.610
<i>I lost the meaning of smiling...</i>

23:09.680 --> 23:13.980
<i>... that day I thought I
lost my place to be.</i>

23:14.050 --> 23:18.420
<i>I wished for your warmth.</i>

23:18.490 --> 23:22.930
<i>We have stopped time.</i>

23:23.160 --> 23:27.260
<i>I had this feeling it was
eventually going to come, but...</i>

23:27.330 --> 23:31.890
<i>... I pretended I didn't know
and buried my loneliness.</i>

23:31.970 --> 23:42.070
<i>I looked down at your feet as the
droplets describing "Good-bye" fell.</i>

23:42.710 --> 23:51.450
<i>I hope that everything that
makes you sad will all disappear.</i>

23:51.520 --> 23:59.900
<i>The words that I said that day
are still tightening my chest.</i>

24:01.370 --> 24:04.390
The woman that holds the key
to the downfall of mankind...

24:05.500 --> 24:07.730
The future that is put
on a balance scale...

24:09.610 --> 24:11.940
To us that reject any type of sacrifice...

24:12.010 --> 24:16.710
...chasing after a possibility that isn't
a tragedy or destruction, we run about.

24:17.720 --> 24:21.910
The feelings sickened
by jealously turn their fangs.

24:23.390 --> 24:29.890
<i>Episode 10, "Providence."</i>

24:26.220 --> 24:29.890
Where are we headed?
